doc:sch-1-sec-187ba a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "187BA Ensuring the confidentiality of information" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A service provider must protect the confidentiality of information that, or information in a document that, the service provider must keep, or cause to be kept, under section 187A by:  (a) encrypting the information; and  (b) protecting the information from unauthorised interference or unauthorised access." ;
    cof:pageNumber "23"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "187C Period for keeping information and documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-187c ;
    values:originalText "(1) The period for which a service provider must keep, or cause to be kept, information or a document under section 187A is:  (a) if the information is about, or the document contains information about, a matter of a kind described in paragraph (a) or (b) in column 2 of item 1 of the table in subsection 187AA(1)—the period:  (i) starting when the information or document came into existence; and  (ii) ending 2 years after the closure of the account to which the information or document relates; or  (b) otherwise—the period:  (i) starting when the information or document came into existence; and  (ii) ending 2 years after it came into existence.  Chapter 5  Co-operation with agencies" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The period for which a service provider must keep, or cause to be kept, information or a document under section 187A is:  (a) if the information is about, or the document contains information about, a matter of a kind described in paragraph (a) or (b) in column 2 of item 1 of the table in subsection 187AA(1)—the period:  (i) starting when the information or document came into existence; and  (ii) ending 2 years after the closure of the account to which the information or document relates; or  (b) otherwise—the period:  (i) starting when the information or document came into existence; and  (ii) ending 2 years after it came into existence.  Chapter 5  Co-operation with agencies"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0ea6e9764bd90d8e7dfd7ea2449fc1eaa91841fe4eed0d56c96c1da4a25ee986" ;
    cof:pageNumber "23"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Period for keeping information and documents" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.23" ;
