    values:originalText "(4) Until the review is completed, the Director-General of Security must keep:  (a) all of the authorisations made under Division 3 of Part 4-1; and  (b) all of the information that he or she is required, by paragraphs 94(2A)(c) to (j) of the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation Act 1979, to include in a report referred to in subsection 94(1) of that Act; relating to the period starting on the commencement of this Part and ending when the review is completed." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Until the review is completed, the Director-General of Security must keep:  (a) all of the authorisations made under Division 3 of Part 4-1; and  (b) all of the information that he or she is required, by paragraphs 94(2A)(c) to (j) of the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation Act 1979, to include in a report referred to in subsection 94(1) of that Act; relating to the period starting on the commencement of this Part and ending when the review is completed."@en ;
