concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-189-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "189(4) Minister may make determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-189-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the Minister must take into account:  (a) the interests of law enforcement and national security; and  (b) the objects of the Telecommunications Act 1997; and  (c) the privacy of the users of telecommunications systems." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the Minister must take into account:  (a) the interests of law enforcement and national security; and  (b) the objects of the Telecommunications Act 1997; and  (c) the privacy of the users of telecommunications systems."@en ;
