doc:sch-1-sec-199 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "199 Commencement of IC plans" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "An IC plan of a carrier or nominated carriage service provider:  (a) comes into force on the day the carrier or provider is notified by a Communications Access Coordinator that the plan has been approved; and  (b) continues in force until the day the carrier or provider is notified by a Communications Access Coordinator that another IC plan of the carrier or provider has been approved." ;
