    values:originalText "(2) On receiving notification from a carrier or provider of an intention to implement a proposed change, a Communications Access Coordinator, and each agency that receives notification of the proposed change, must treat the proposed change as confidential.  Co-operation with agencies  Chapter 5 Delivery capability  Part 5-5  Section 203  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
