doc:sch-1-sec-204-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "204(2) Obligations of persons covered by a determination" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), if a carrier is required to have delivery capability in relation to a particular kind of telecommunications service under the determination, the carrier is required to ensure that the capability is developed, installed and maintained. Note: The cost of this capability is to be borne by the interception agencies: see Division 3 of Part 5-6." ;
