    values:originalText "(2) If a carrier receives a notice under subsection (1), the carrier must, within the period specified in the notice:  (a) carry out the examination concerned; and  (b) report in writing to the ACMA on the results of the examination." ;
    cof:pageNumber "63"^^xsd:integer .

