    skos:prefLabel "300 Regulations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-300 ;
    values:originalText "The Governor-General may make regulations, not inconsistent with this Act, prescribing matters:  (a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed; or  (b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this Act.  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
