doc:sch-1-sec-8-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "8(2) General electronic content service" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a general electronic content service merely because the person supplies a transmission service that enables material to be accessed or delivered." ;
    cof:pageNumber "90"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-8-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(3) General electronic content service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a general electronic content service merely because the person provides a billing service, or a fee collection service, in relation to a general electronic content service. 9  When material is posted on a general electronic content service  For the purposes of this Schedule, material is posted on a general electronic content service by a person if:  (a) the person is an end-user of the service; and  International production orders  Schedule 1 Introduction  Part 1  Clause 10  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) the person causes the material to be accessible to, or delivered to, one or more other end-users using the service." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a general electronic content service merely because the person provides a billing service, or a fee collection service, in relation to a general electronic content service. 9  When material is posted on a general electronic content service  For the purposes of this Schedule, material is posted on a general electronic content service by a person if:  (a) the person is an end-user of the service; and  International production orders  Schedule 1 Introduction  Part 1  Clause 10  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) the person causes the material to be accessible to, or delivered to, one or more other end-users using the service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ce42d1a9acb444065624ee989156311bafb3fb73bb65198971d444aca8fa82f5" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-8 ;
    cof:pageNumber "90"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person does not provide a general electronic content service merely because they provide a billing service or a fee collection service." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.90" ;
