doc:sch-1-sec-10-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10(2) Uploaded material" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of the application of this Schedule to a prescribed communications provider that is a body corporate, the provider is based in a foreign country if, and only if:  (a) the provider is incorporated in the foreign country; or  (b) the provider has its principal place of business in the foreign country. Operates in a foreign country" ;
    cof:pageNumber "91"^^xsd:integer .

