concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17 Nominated ART Intelligence and Security member"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-17 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Attorney-General may, by writing, nominate a person who:  (a) holds one of the following appointments to the Administrative Review Tribunal:  (ii) senior member;  (iii) general member; and  (b) is a member of the Intelligence and Security jurisdictional area of the Administrative Review Tribunal; to issue international production orders under Part 4 of this Schedule.  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Attorney-General may, by writing, nominate a person who:  (a) holds one of the following appointments to the Administrative Review Tribunal:  (ii) senior member;  (iii) general member; and  (b) is a member of the Intelligence and Security jurisdictional area of the Administrative Review Tribunal; to issue international production orders under Part 4 of this Schedule.  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ebf544213ea206f0c64bdc0ffb0dbd6ccc7a1e054864d40bf044374771ba8259" ;
