doc:sch-1-sec-17a-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "17A(3) Urgent circumstances" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, it is necessary, because of urgent circumstances, for the Attorney-General to consent orally to the making of an application under Part 4 of this Schedule for an international production order if, and only if:  (a) the delay caused by consenting in writing may be prejudicial to security; and  (b) it is not practicable in the circumstances to consent in writing.  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    cof:pageNumber "97"^^xsd:integer .

