concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-22-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22(3) Application for international production order—enforcement of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-22-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The application must be made on the interception agency’s behalf by:  (a) in the case of the Australian Federal Police—a member of the Australian Federal Police; or  (b) in the case of the National Anti-Corruption Commission:  (i) the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner; or  (ii) a National Anti-Corruption Deputy Commissioner; or  (iii) a staff member of the NACC who is authorised in writing by the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner for the purposes of this paragraph; or  (c) in the case of the ACC:  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The application must be made on the interception agency’s behalf by:  (a) in the case of the Australian Federal Police—a member of the Australian Federal Police; or  (b) in the case of the National Anti-Corruption Commission:  (i) the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner; or  (ii) a National Anti-Corruption Deputy Commissioner; or  (iii) a staff member of the NACC who is authorised in writing by the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner for the purposes of this paragraph; or  (c) in the case of the ACC:  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3236efd1d0e9c8e5379bff2db3e1f66e6be55ad0cc22b5fa8747cbf2ed8ae412" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-22 ;
