concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-32 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32 Issue of further international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-32 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) an international production order (the original order) was issued under clause 30; and  (b) the original order was in respect of one or more individual transmission services; and  (c) the original order was directed to a prescribed communications provider;  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) an international production order (the original order) was issued under clause 30; and  (b) the original order was in respect of one or more individual transmission services; and  (c) the original order was directed to a prescribed communications provider;  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
