concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-40-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40(4) Content of international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to make a copy of stored communications available to the criminal law-enforcement agency, the order may require the provider to make that copy available to the agency in a specified way." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to make a copy of stored communications available to the criminal law-enforcement agency, the order may require the provider to make that copy available to the agency in a specified way."@en ;
