    cof:title "53(1) Form of application" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subclause (2), an application under clause 52 for an international production order must be in writing." ;
    cof:pageNumber "139"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-53-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53(2) Form of application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-53-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the person making an application under clause 52 for an international production order on a Part 5.3 IPO agency’s behalf:  (a) is the chief officer of the agency or a person in relation to whom an authorisation by the chief officer is in force under subclause (3); and  (b) thinks it necessary, because of urgent circumstances, to make the application by telephone; the person may make the application by telephone. Note: See also clause 17A (urgent circumstances) and clause 172 (action required)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If the person making an application under clause 52 for an international production order on a Part 5.3 IPO agency’s behalf:  (a) is the chief officer of the agency or a person in relation to whom an authorisation by the chief officer is in force under subclause (3); and  (b) thinks it necessary, because of urgent circumstances, to make the application by telephone; the person may make the application by telephone. Note: See also clause 17A (urgent circumstances) and clause 172 (action required)."@en ;
