concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-53-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53(3) Form of application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-53-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The chief officer of a Part 5.3 IPO agency may authorise in writing, for the purposes of subclause (2), persons who, or classes of persons who, are entitled under clause 52 to make applications on the agency’s behalf." ;
