    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency of Queensland applies, under clause 52, to an eligible Judge or nominated ART member for an international production order under clause 60 that is in respect of:  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to Part 5.3 supervisory orders  Part 3 International production orders relating to interception: Part 5.3 supervisory orders" ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency of Queensland applies, under clause 52, to an eligible Judge or nominated ART member for an international production order under clause 60 that is in respect of:  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to Part 5.3 supervisory orders  Part 3 International production orders relating to interception: Part 5.3 supervisory orders"@en ;
