doc:sch-1-sec-59 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "59 Application by Part 5.3 IPO agency of Queensland" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency of Queensland applies, under clause 52, to an eligible Judge or nominated ART member for an international production order under clause 60 that is in respect of:  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to Part 5.3 supervisory orders  Part 3 International production orders relating to interception: Part 5.3 supervisory orders" ;
    cof:pageNumber "142"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-60 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "60 Issue of international production order—Part 5.3 supervisory"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-60 ;
    values:originalText "order Scope  (1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency applies, under clause 52, to an eligible Judge or nominated ART member for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of:  (i) one or more individual transmission services; or  (ii) one or more individual message/call application services; and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the eligible Judge or nominated ART member is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the eligible Judge or nominated ART member under this Division in connection with the application, that:  (a) in the case of an application for an international production order that is in respect of one or more individual transmission services—there are reasonable grounds for suspecting that:  (i) the prescribed communications provider owns or operates a telecommunications network that is, or is likely to be, used to supply those individual transmission services; or  (ii) the prescribed communications provider supplies those individual transmission services; and  (b) in the case of an application for an international production order that is in respect of one or more individual message/call application services—there are reasonable grounds for suspecting that the prescribed communications provider  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to Part 5.3 supervisory orders  Part 3 International production orders relating to interception: Part 5.3 supervisory orders" ;
    skos:definition "order Scope  (1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency applies, under clause 52, to an eligible Judge or nominated ART member for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of:  (i) one or more individual transmission services; or  (ii) one or more individual message/call application services; and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the eligible Judge or nominated ART member is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the eligible Judge or nominated ART member under this Division in connection with the application, that:  (a) in the case of an application for an international production order that is in respect of one or more individual transmission services—there are reasonable grounds for suspecting that:  (i) the prescribed communications provider owns or operates a telecommunications network that is, or is likely to be, used to supply those individual transmission services; or  (ii) the prescribed communications provider supplies those individual transmission services; and  (b) in the case of an application for an international production order that is in respect of one or more individual message/call application services—there are reasonable grounds for suspecting that the prescribed communications provider  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to Part 5.3 supervisory orders  Part 3 International production orders relating to interception: Part 5.3 supervisory orders"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0c3933965d89cbceb8342c6b60dc0de12b88893cf57d4f88711874adeceac36a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "144"^^xsd:integer ;
