concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-70-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70(5) Content of international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-70-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:  (a) require that a copy of stored communications be made available to the Part 5.3 IPO agency directly; or  (b) require that a copy of stored communications be made available to the Part 5.3 IPO agency indirectly via the Australian Designated Authority." ;
