concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-77 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77 Giving further information to issuing authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-77 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An issuing authority may require further information to be given in connection with an application under clause 72 to the issuing authority for an international production order.  (2) The further information:  (a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing; and  (b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the issuing authority directs. Subdivision B—International production orders relating to telecommunications data" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An issuing authority may require further information to be given in connection with an application under clause 72 to the issuing authority for an international production order.  (2) The further information:  (a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing; and  (b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the issuing authority directs. Subdivision B—International production orders relating to telecommunications data"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5f26f23002d943b41608b1258cc9ef38e2c6daf6fc88b63b9eab2c382cb4d197" ;
