concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-78 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78 Issue of international production order—Part 5.3 supervisory"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-78 ;
    values:originalText "order Scope  (1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency applies, under clause 72, to an issuing authority for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the issuing authority is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the issuing authority under this Division in connection with the application, that:  (a) a Part 5.3 supervisory order is in force in relation to the relevant person; and  (b) there are reasonable grounds for suspecting that the prescribed communications provider holds, or is likely to commence to hold, any of the following telecommunications data:  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "order Scope  (1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency applies, under clause 72, to an issuing authority for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the issuing authority is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the issuing authority under this Division in connection with the application, that:  (a) a Part 5.3 supervisory order is in force in relation to the relevant person; and  (b) there are reasonable grounds for suspecting that the prescribed communications provider holds, or is likely to commence to hold, any of the following telecommunications data:  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0c3933965d89cbceb8342c6b60dc0de12b88893cf57d4f88711874adeceac36a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "169"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-78-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-78-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.169" .
