concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-80 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80 Issue of further international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80 ;
    values:originalText "If:  (a) an international production order (the original order) was issued under clause 78; and  (b) the original order was in respect of a particular person; and  (c) the original order was directed to a prescribed communications provider; this Schedule does not prevent the issue of a further international production order under clause 78 that:  (d) is in respect of the person; and  (e) is directed to the provider.  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to Part 5.3 supervisory orders  Part 3 Notification to Ombudsman or the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security by" ;
    skos:definition "If:  (a) an international production order (the original order) was issued under clause 78; and  (b) the original order was in respect of a particular person; and  (c) the original order was directed to a prescribed communications provider; this Schedule does not prevent the issue of a further international production order under clause 78 that:  (d) is in respect of the person; and  (e) is directed to the provider.  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to Part 5.3 supervisory orders  Part 3 Notification to Ombudsman or the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security by"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "91bbad84999859b1ecf24ab517697e4d21c567a34a5e6215460aaecd1df0cff9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "174"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Issue of further international production order under clause 78 that is in respect of the person and directed to the provider." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
