concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-86-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86(4) Affidavits to accompany written application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-86-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the application is for an international production order in respect of one or more individual message/call application services, the affidavit must set out the following information, so far as it can be derived from the Organisation’s records:  (a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international production orders that the Organisation has made under clause 83 in relation to those individual message/call application services;  (b) the number of international production orders (if any) previously issued in response to such applications;  (c) particulars of the use made by the Organisation of intercepted messages, voice calls or video calls made available to the Organisation under such orders.  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the application is for an international production order in respect of one or more individual message/call application services, the affidavit must set out the following information, so far as it can be derived from the Organisation’s records:  (a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international production orders that the Organisation has made under clause 83 in relation to those individual message/call application services;  (b) the number of international production orders (if any) previously issued in response to such applications;  (c) particulars of the use made by the Organisation of intercepted messages, voice calls or video calls made available to the Organisation under such orders.  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2474c896cc1338d9a4f803184e2fdcc4630cc82158c77e8ab6a53f151fec5bf1" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-86 ;
    cof:pageNumber "181"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must provide specific information about previous applications and international production orders." ;
    dc:description "(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international production orders that the Organisation has made under clause 83 in relation to those individual message/call application services;" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.181" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-86-ss-4-norm .
