doc:sch-1-sec-88-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "88(1) Giving further information to nominated ART Intelligence and" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A nominated ART Intelligence and Security member may require further information to be given in connection with an application under clause 83 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member for an international production order." ;
    cof:pageNumber "182"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-88-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "88(2) Giving further information to nominated ART Intelligence and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-88-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The further information:  (a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing; and  (b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member directs.  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to national security  Part 4 International production orders relating to interception: national security  Division 2  Clause 89  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Subdivision B—International production orders relating to interception" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The further information:  (a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing; and  (b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member directs.  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to national security  Part 4 International production orders relating to interception: national security  Division 2  Clause 89  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Subdivision B—International production orders relating to interception"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e3628cbd12eab2950104bc20409a4b994831a407005300ecbde20bb0ff3202cf" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-88 ;
    cof:pageNumber "182"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must provide further information on oath or otherwise as directed by nominated ART Intelligence and Security member." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
