concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-90 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "90 Content of international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-90 ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies to an international production order issued under clause 89. Content  (2) The order must be signed by the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member who issued it.  (3) The order must set out the following:  (a) the date on which the order was issued;  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
