concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-100 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "100 Issue of further international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-100 ;
    values:originalText "If:  (a) an international production order (the original order) was issued under clause 98; and  (b) the original order was in respect of a particular person; and  (c) the original order was directed to a prescribed communications provider; this Schedule does not prevent the issue of a further international production order under clause 98 that:  (d) is in respect of the person; and  (e) is directed to the provider.  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to national security  Part 4 International production orders relating to telecommunications data: national security" ;
    skos:definition "If:  (a) an international production order (the original order) was issued under clause 98; and  (b) the original order was in respect of a particular person; and  (c) the original order was directed to a prescribed communications provider; this Schedule does not prevent the issue of a further international production order under clause 98 that:  (d) is in respect of the person; and  (e) is directed to the provider.  International production orders  Schedule 1 International production orders relating to national security  Part 4 International production orders relating to telecommunications data: national security"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "61984ca211b27a63843aee80ef008812c60253533ceee63b5d0ce45ce98c9d10" ;
    cof:pageNumber "202"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Issue of further international production order under clause 98 that is in respect of the person and directed to the provider." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.202" ;
