    values:originalText "Security member  (1) A nominated ART Intelligence and Security member may require further information to be given in connection with an application under clause 101 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member for an international production order.  (2) The further information:  (a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing; and  (b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member directs. Subdivision B—International production orders relating to telecommunications data" ;
    cof:pageNumber "205"^^xsd:integer .

