    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-106-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The further information:  (a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing; and  (b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member directs. Subdivision B—International production orders relating to telecommunications data" ;
