concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-107 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "107 Issue of international production order—national security"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-107 ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies if the Organisation applies, under clause 101, to a nominated ART Intelligence and Security member for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member under this Division in connection with the application, that:  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This clause applies if the Organisation applies, under clause 101, to a nominated ART Intelligence and Security member for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member under this Division in connection with the application, that:  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
