concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-114-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "114(3) Revocation of international production orders—relevant agency"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-114-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of the application of subclause (1) to an international production order issued under Part 3 of this Schedule on the ground that a Part 5.3 supervisory order was in force in relation to a particular person when the international production order was issued, that ground is taken to have ceased to exist if, and only if, neither that Part 5.3 supervisory order, nor any succeeding Part 5.3 supervisory order, is in force." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of the application of subclause (1) to an international production order issued under Part 3 of this Schedule on the ground that a Part 5.3 supervisory order was in force in relation to a particular person when the international production order was issued, that ground is taken to have ceased to exist if, and only if, neither that Part 5.3 supervisory order, nor any succeeding Part 5.3 supervisory order, is in force."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3d48601573caa2f80c489560cc9d032461e36527fbbe97417a43a1e63127fdda" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-114 ;
    cof:pageNumber "216"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ground for revocation of international production orders ceases if no Part 5.3 supervisory order is in force." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
