    cof:title "118(2) Delegation by the chief officer of a relevant agency" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In performing functions, or exercising powers, under a delegation under subclause (1), the delegate must comply with any directions of the chief officer.  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
