    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014, a Communications Access Coordinator is an authorised applicant in relation to a civil penalty provision in this Part. Relevant court" ;
    cof:pageNumber "226"^^xsd:integer .

