concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-126-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "126(4) Civil penalty provision—enforcement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-126-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Paragraph 82(5)(a) of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014, as it applies in relation to a civil penalty provision in this Part, has effect as if “5 times” were omitted and “200 times” were substituted. Extra-territorial application" ;
