concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-126-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "126(5) Civil penalty provision—enforcement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-126-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014, as it applies in relation to a civil penalty provision in this Part, extends to acts, omissions, matters and things outside Australia.  International production orders  Schedule 1 Reporting and record-keeping requirements  Part 9 Introduction  Division 1  Clause 127  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014, as it applies in relation to a civil penalty provision in this Part, extends to acts, omissions, matters and things outside Australia.  International production orders  Schedule 1 Reporting and record-keeping requirements  Part 9 Introduction  Division 1  Clause 127  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
