concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "132(2) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-132-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If:  (a) subparagraph (1)(a)(i) applies; and  (b) the chief officer of the relevant agency is satisfied that the information is Part 5.3 information; the chief officer must advise the Minister in writing not to include the information in the next Ministerial report." ;
