concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "132(3) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-132-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the Minister is satisfied, on the advice of the chief officer, that the information is Part 5.3 information, the Minister must:  (a) notify the chief officer in writing; and  (b) not include the information in any Ministerial report until the Minister decides otherwise under subclause (5). Inclusion of information in subsequent report—relevant agency" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the Minister is satisfied, on the advice of the chief officer, that the information is Part 5.3 information, the Minister must:  (a) notify the chief officer in writing; and  (b) not include the information in any Ministerial report until the Minister decides otherwise under subclause (5). Inclusion of information in subsequent report—relevant agency"@en ;
