concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "132(4) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-132-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the information has not been included in a Ministerial report because of subclause (3), the chief officer must, before the Minister prepares the next Ministerial report:  (a) reconsider whether the information is Part 5.3 information; and  (b) if the chief officer is satisfied that the information is not" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the information has not been included in a Ministerial report because of subclause (3), the chief officer must, before the Minister prepares the next Ministerial report:  (a) reconsider whether the information is Part 5.3 information; and  (b) if the chief officer is satisfied that the information is not"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "10192f651ad462156773d461e9bbb5e5d13646acac8c6737d08423dc385ee227" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132 ;
    cof:pageNumber "232"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Chief officer must reconsider information before Minister prepares next report." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
