concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-143-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143(3) Inspection of records—Australian Designated Authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-143-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Before inspecting records of the Australian Designated Authority under this clause, the Ombudsman must give reasonable notice to the Australian Designated Authority of when the inspection will occur." ;
