concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-143-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143(4) Inspection of records—Australian Designated Authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-143-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Australian Designated Authority must ensure that members of staff of the Attorney-General’s Department give the Ombudsman any assistance the Ombudsman reasonably requires to enable the Ombudsman to perform functions under this clause." ;
