doc:sch-1-sec-145-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "145(2) Ombudsman to be given information and access despite other" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) However:  (a) the information, the answer, or the fact that the person has given access to the document, as the case may be; or  (b) any information or thing (including a document) obtained as a direct or indirect consequence of giving the information, answering the question or giving access to the document; is not admissible in evidence against the person except in a proceeding by way of a prosecution for:  (c) an offence against clause 152; or  (d) an offence against Part 7.4 or 7.7 of the Criminal Code." ;
    cof:pageNumber "257"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-145-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "145(3) Ombudsman to be given information and access despite other"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-145-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Nothing in clause 152, or in any other law, prevents an officer of a relevant agency from:  (a) giving information to an inspecting officer (whether orally or in writing and whether or not in answer to a question); or  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Nothing in clause 152, or in any other law, prevents an officer of a relevant agency from:  (a) giving information to an inspecting officer (whether orally or in writing and whether or not in answer to a question); or  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "26e0d62e0279cf267f1974b5166540ba6231c34540d2445989d9d5f2608e04e4" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-145 ;
    cof:pageNumber "257"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Officer may give information to inspecting officer" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
