concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-148 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "148 Delegation by Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-148 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Ombudsman may, by writing, delegate:  (a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or  (b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the Ombudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an employee responsible to that person;  International production orders  Schedule 1 Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Part 10  Clause 149  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Part other than a power to report to the Minister.  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Ombudsman may, by writing, delegate:  (a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or  (b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the Ombudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an employee responsible to that person;  International production orders  Schedule 1 Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Part 10  Clause 149  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Part other than a power to report to the Minister.  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b9efb7fe75f8436f90c867c0dcf7c70a2d334e9a0468d9dc687d89271be99ca5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "260"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-148-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-148-ss-2 ;
