    values:originalText "(3) A document purporting to be a certificate issued under subclause (1) or (2):  (a) is to be received in evidence in a proceeding in Australia without further proof; and  (b) in a proceeding in Australia, is conclusive evidence of the matters stated in the document.  International production orders  Schedule 1 Evidentiary certificates  Part 12  Clause 162  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
