concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-165-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "165(4) Evidentiary certificates—telecommunications data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-165-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A document purporting to be a certificate issued under subclause (1), (2) or (3):  (a) is to be received in evidence in a proceeding in Australia without further proof; and  (b) in a proceeding in Australia, is prima facie evidence of the matters stated in the document.  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "(4) A document purporting to be a certificate issued under subclause (1), (2) or (3):  (a) is to be received in evidence in a proceeding in Australia without further proof; and  (b) in a proceeding in Australia, is prima facie evidence of the matters stated in the document.  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
