concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-171 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "171 Electronic service of documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-171 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given to a person by the Australian Designated Authority:  (i) an international production order;  (ii) a certified copy of an international production order;  (iii) an instrument of revocation of an international production order;  (iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international production order; and  (b) the person has nominated an electronic address for service in a document given by the person to the Australian Designated Authority; the order, copy or instrument is taken to have been given to the person if it is sent to the nominated electronic address for service.  (2) If:  (a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given to the Australian Designated Authority by a person, a relevant agency or the Organisation:  (i) an international production order;  (ii) a certified copy of an international production order;  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given to a person by the Australian Designated Authority:  (i) an international production order;  (ii) a certified copy of an international production order;  (iii) an instrument of revocation of an international production order;  (iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international production order; and  (b) the person has nominated an electronic address for service in a document given by the person to the Australian Designated Authority; the order, copy or instrument is taken to have been given to the person if it is sent to the nominated electronic address for service.  (2) If:  (a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given to the Australian Designated Authority by a person, a relevant agency or the Organisation:  (i) an international production order;  (ii) a certified copy of an international production order;  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "14902bf1c428442ecf43cbfcee7acde058fcea1c3caa2e40a6124bd87f656654" ;
    cof:pageNumber "299"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-171-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-171-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.299" .
