    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given to a person by the Australian Designated Authority:  (i) an international production order;  (ii) a certified copy of an international production order;  (iii) an instrument of revocation of an international production order;  (iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international production order; and  (b) the person has nominated an electronic address for service in a document given by the person to the Australian Designated Authority; the order, copy or instrument is taken to have been given to the person if it is sent to the nominated electronic address for service.  (2) If:  (a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given to the Australian Designated Authority by a person, a relevant agency or the Organisation:  (i) an international production order;  (ii) a certified copy of an international production order;  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    cof:pageNumber "299"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-171-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "171(1) Electronic service of documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-171-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given to a person by the Australian Designated Authority:  (i) an international production order;  (ii) a certified copy of an international production order;  (iii) an instrument of revocation of an international production order;  (iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international production order; and  (b) the person has nominated an electronic address for service in a document given by the person to the Australian Designated Authority; the order, copy or instrument is taken to have been given to the person if it is sent to the nominated electronic address for service." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given to a person by the Australian Designated Authority:  (i) an international production order;  (ii) a certified copy of an international production order;  (iii) an instrument of revocation of an international production order;  (iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international production order; and  (b) the person has nominated an electronic address for service in a document given by the person to the Australian Designated Authority; the order, copy or instrument is taken to have been given to the person if it is sent to the nominated electronic address for service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "69b5fb0bce621d9a2f0d937dadb0b7e3e156e75603556126d9fada7c51794e82" ;
