concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-172-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "172(6) International production order issued in response to a telephone"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-172-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If:  (a) the Australian Designated Authority gave the international production order to the prescribed communications provider to whom the order is directed; and  (b) the order was subsequently cancelled under subclause (3); the Australian Designated Authority must:  Schedule 1  International production orders" ;
    skos:definition "(6) If:  (a) the Australian Designated Authority gave the international production order to the prescribed communications provider to whom the order is directed; and  (b) the order was subsequently cancelled under subclause (3); the Australian Designated Authority must:  Schedule 1  International production orders"@en ;
