    values:originalText "law-enforcement agency  (1) A document certified in writing by a certifying officer of a criminal law-enforcement agency to be a true copy of an international production order issued under clause 39 is to be received in evidence in a proceeding mentioned in clause 153 or 158 as if it were the original international production order.  (2) The document is to be known as a certified copy of the original international production order." ;
    cof:pageNumber "303"^^xsd:integer .

