doc:sch-1-sec-180-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "180(1) Minor defects in connection with international production order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) information is purportedly obtained in accordance with an international production order; and  (b) there is a defect or irregularity in relation to the international production order; and  (c) apart from that defect or irregularity, the information would have been obtained in accordance with the international production order; the information is taken to have been obtained in accordance with the international production order." ;
    cof:pageNumber "306"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-180-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "180(2) Minor defects in connection with international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-180-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of subclause (1), a defect or irregularity in relation to an international production order means a defect or irregularity:  (a) that is not a substantial defect or irregularity; and  (b) that is:  (i) in, or in connection with the issue of, a document purporting to be the international production order; or  International production orders  Schedule 1 Miscellaneous  Part 14  Clause 181  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (ii) in connection with compliance with the international production order; or  (iii) in connection with purported compliance with a document purporting to be the international production order." ;
    skos:definition "(2) For the purposes of subclause (1), a defect or irregularity in relation to an international production order means a defect or irregularity:  (a) that is not a substantial defect or irregularity; and  (b) that is:  (i) in, or in connection with the issue of, a document purporting to be the international production order; or  International production orders  Schedule 1 Miscellaneous  Part 14  Clause 181  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (ii) in connection with compliance with the international production order; or  (iii) in connection with purported compliance with a document purporting to be the international production order."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a778cc0519a6b2d8c7444a4015cbf6c1b1d56b339d61452515902f0f5d8e154b" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-180 ;
    cof:pageNumber "306"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defect or irregularity in relation to an international production order means a defect or irregularity that is not substantial and related to the issue of a document purporting to be the international production order, compliance with the international production order, or purported compliance." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.306" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-180-ss-2-norm .
